      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解第一个方程，得到$x=-7$或$x=7$. 再由方程$y=\\frac{21}{x}$求出对应的",
        "$y$值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$x=-7$，那么$y=-3$；如果$x=7$，那么$y=3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "答：$\\{(-7,-3),(7,3)\\}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "102",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "102. 用代入消元法解下列方程组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}5x+11y=-1,\\\\↵x=3y+5;\\end{cases}$　б) $\\begin{cases}x=-2y-1,\\\\7x-20y=146;\\end{cases}$",
        "в) $\\begin{cases}12x-y=16,\\\\↵5x+3y=75;\\end{cases}$　г) $\\begin{cases}7x+6y=2,\\\\6x-5y=93;\\end{cases}$",
        "д) $\\begin{cases}4x+3y=43,\\\\↵5x-7y=43;\\end{cases}$　е) $\\begin{cases}8x-9y=4,\\\\-3x+4y=1.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "103",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "103. 解下列方程组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}x^2-2y^2=7,\\\\↵x=y+2;\\end{cases}$　б) $\\begin{cases}x^2-2xy=7,\\\\x=3y+2;\\end{cases}$",
        "в) $\\begin{cases}x^2-5xy=10,\\\\↵x-5y=1;\\end{cases}$　г) $\\begin{cases}5xy-y^2=9,\\\\2x-y=3;\\end{cases}$",
        "д) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=100,\\\\↵3x-2y=2;\\end{cases}$　е) $\\begin{cases}2x^2-3y^2=24,\\\\2x-3y=0;\\end{cases}$",
        "ж) $\\begin{cases}4x^2-9y^2=15,\\\\↵2x+3y=5;\\end{cases}$　з) $\\begin{cases}x^2+xy-y^2=11,\\\\x-2y=1;\\end{cases}$",
        "и) $\\begin{cases}x^2+xy-3y=9,\\\\↵3x+2y=-1.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "104",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "104. 用图解法解下列方程组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=25,\\\\↵x-y=5;\\end{cases}$　б) $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=20,\\\\xy=-8;\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
